// When started, waits for rxvalid to be asserted, which is the alignment phase. Waits
// for SDP (gen1/2) or SDS (Gen3+) for data phase to begin. During data phase, counts
// number of byte errors. A decoder/disparity/elastic buffer error counts as a byte error.
// Dataphase is asserted when data phase is entered. Test stops if an EIOSQ is detected,
// and done is asserted.
// May also be run for a set amount of time. If max_len is set, done will asserted after
// that number of clock cycles, regardless if alignment phase has been entered. In this instance
// dataphase will be deasserted, indicating an error. Test still stops if EIOSQ is detected.

// SKP OS's are ignored.

